555 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 213 0 R
/E (We knew Taylor only by name when we called to see if she would help us find an investment home to fulfill requirements of a 1031 Exchange. She was extremely knowledgeable, friendly and helpful in our house search. She sent many choices of homes in our desired category. Once a home was chosen she went to great lengths to answer every question, attend to every detail and keep us informed each step along the way. Even when she had to deal with ornery, uncompromising sellers she kept her cool and continued to smooth out any difficulties before they happened. We would absolutely refer friends and family to work with Taylor when they are looking to either buy or sell in this area.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
