557 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 213 0 R
/E (We have now bought and sold 4 houses with Taylor. We enjoy working with her so much. She is kind, professional, detail-oriented, and efficient. So much so that we made the decision to sell our house and bought our dream home, in this market, in less than 2 months. We happily recommend her to our friends and family and look forward to working with her again.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
